{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39713","headline":"绦州郑尚书 · 黄滔","name":"绦州郑尚书","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"旌旗日日展东风，云稼连山雪刃空。\n剖竹已知垂凤食，摘珠何必到龙宫。\n谏垣虚位期飞步，翰苑含毫待纪公。\n谁谓唐城诸父老，今时得见蜀文翁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"黄滔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39713.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39713","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}